  "notes": [
    "Chainlink SVR is on by default on Base: the long-standing ENS eth-usd proxy 0x71041ddd... is the DualAggregator secondary proxy (SVR view, may lag by the cutoff when reports go through the private route); 0x50015f8b... is the primary (standard view). Both read aggregator 0x05c84a58... (verified on-chain, same answer at the check block).",
